{"id":"n85169-1-8","stage":2,"title":"해롭다 · 有害","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85169-1-8-1","ko":"담배는 건강에 해로우니까 그만 피우세요.","zh":"吸烟有害健康，还是别抽了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담배는","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강에","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해로우니까","meaning":"有害","explanation":"해롭다：有害；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"해롭다","audio":"/audio/9dd375bb31bc6bfb5259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85169","senseId":"1","lemma":"해롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那样，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那样，到此为止","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"3","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피우세요.","meaning":"吸，抽","explanation":"피우다：吸，抽；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"피우다","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73272","senseId":"6","lemma":"피우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"9dd375bb31bc6bfb","term":"해롭다","zh":"有害","audio":"/audio/9dd375bb31bc6bfb5259.mp3","entryId":"85169","definition":"没有帮助，有成为害处的地方。","pronunciation":["해ː롭따"]},{"id":"38c09c96aa077d27","term":"그만","zh":"就那样，到此为止","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3","entryId":"36428","definition":"就做到那个程度。","pronunciation":["그만"]},{"id":"6e1ba3221dbae36d","term":"피우다","zh":"吸，抽","audio":"/audio/6e1ba3221dbae36d0573.mp3","entryId":"73272","definition":"给某个物质点上火，把冒出的烟吸入之后又吐出来。","pronunciation":["피우다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ac5444726384e0fff43.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85169-1-8-2","ko":"네, 끊으려고 해도 잘 안 되네요.","zh":"是啊，就算想戒烟也实在做不到呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊으려고","meaning":"戒","explanation":"끊다：戒；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"4","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해도","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되네요.","meaning":"顺利，不错","explanation":"되다：顺利，不错；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c2d51c5ca94e5957","term":"끊다","zh":"戒","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3","entryId":"62839","definition":"不再做习惯性的行为。","pronunciation":["끈타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"顺利，不错","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"事情发展得很好。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba5e852034cb4c80f93e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.307,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85169","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1337,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["吸烟有害健康，还是别抽了吧。","是啊，就算想戒烟也实在做不到呢。","您母亲是做什么工作的呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["吸烟有害健康，还是别抽了吧。","是啊，就算想戒烟也实在做不到呢。","您母亲是做什么工作的呢？"],"answer":1}]}
